    "Thanks. We're reading it now, and your plan will update in a few minutes." : {
      "comment" : "After the learner uploaded the document research asked for",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danke. Wir lesen das Dokument jetzt und dein Plan wird in ein paar Minuten aktualisiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
