    "Your recent mistakes were slips, not a rule to learn." : {
      "comment" : "Explains a pattern of typos",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine letzten Fehler waren kleine Versehen. Du musst dafür keine Regel lernen."
